{"4333440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SNOTROCKET™", "steam_appid": 4333440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/88a3304fa288c0f03f907f2af3082a00.avif?t=1787238660\" width=1287 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNOTROCKET™ is a chaotic 2–5 player online co-op space panic game</strong> where you and your friends are violently ill and racing to make a cure before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fresh from a distant alien planet, <strong>your crew has brought home a mysterious extraterrestrial virus</strong>. <br>You're now quarantined together aboard your ship whilst mission control waits for you to find a cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail, and they'll &quot;<i>solve&quot;</i> the outbreak themselves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER. PROBABLY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/6b4fd027b291c86c983c95148637e525.poster.avif?t=1787238660\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/6b4fd027b291c86c983c95148637e525.webm?t=1787238660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/6b4fd027b291c86c983c95148637e525.mp4?t=1787238660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the ship running, activate machinery and complete increasingly bizarre tasks to gather the data Shippy needs to produce your cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, Shippy also has a list of <i>totally necessary</i> additional tasks for your crew to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You probably shouldn't ignore him.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GET SICK. GET EVERYONE ELSE SICK.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/cdfee4536616fc98abc7a7e754b66124.poster.avif?t=1787238660\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/cdfee4536616fc98abc7a7e754b66124.webm?t=1787238660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/cdfee4536616fc98abc7a7e754b66124.mp4?t=1787238660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fragile peanut anatomy was not designed for uncontrollable sneezing, catastrophic flatulence and whatever else this alien infection decides to do to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Symptoms get worse as the outbreak progresses, interfere with your ability to work and can spread between crew members at the worst possible moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thankfully, we've provided a selection of <i>mostly</i> effective treatments to help you feel <i>temporarily</i> less disgusting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE THE CURE BEFORE THEY MAKE YOU DISAPPEAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission control has already made its decision. The missile is on its way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/bd0d8765733b872eb17194cb891da0d7.poster.avif?t=1787238660\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/bd0d8765733b872eb17194cb891da0d7.webm?t=1787238660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/bd0d8765733b872eb17194cb891da0d7.mp4?t=1787238660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete enough cure tasks to boot up the cure machine, then cure each other before the missile reaches the ship!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>ALL ABOARD THE SNOTROCKET!</strong></i></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/88a3304fa288c0f03f907f2af3082a00.avif?t=1787238660\" width=1287 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNOTROCKET™ is a chaotic 2–5 player online co-op space panic game</strong> where you and your friends are violently ill and racing to make a cure before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fresh from a distant alien planet, <strong>your crew has brought home a mysterious extraterrestrial virus</strong>. <br>You're now quarantined together aboard your ship whilst mission control waits for you to find a cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail, and they'll &quot;<i>solve&quot;</i> the outbreak themselves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER. PROBABLY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/6b4fd027b291c86c983c95148637e525.poster.avif?t=1787238660\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/6b4fd027b291c86c983c95148637e525.webm?t=1787238660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/6b4fd027b291c86c983c95148637e525.mp4?t=1787238660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the ship running, activate machinery and complete increasingly bizarre tasks to gather the data Shippy needs to produce your cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, Shippy also has a list of <i>totally necessary</i> additional tasks for your crew to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You probably shouldn't ignore him.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GET SICK. GET EVERYONE ELSE SICK.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/cdfee4536616fc98abc7a7e754b66124.poster.avif?t=1787238660\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/cdfee4536616fc98abc7a7e754b66124.webm?t=1787238660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/cdfee4536616fc98abc7a7e754b66124.mp4?t=1787238660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fragile peanut anatomy was not designed for uncontrollable sneezing, catastrophic flatulence and whatever else this alien infection decides to do to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Symptoms get worse as the outbreak progresses, interfere with your ability to work and can spread between crew members at the worst possible moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thankfully, we've provided a selection of <i>mostly</i> effective treatments to help you feel <i>temporarily</i> less disgusting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE THE CURE BEFORE THEY MAKE YOU DISAPPEAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission control has already made its decision. The missile is on its way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333440/extras/b